} else {
    this.toggleDeleteModal(true);
}
```
Wait, Proposal 1 says "The above is reusable so we can create an util like `dismissKeyboard(onDismissed)` and do `dismissKeyboard(() => this.toggleDeleteModal(true))`".

Let's look at Proposal 0. Adding `onModalWillHide` to `ConfirmModal`. `ReactNativeModal` already supports `onModalWillHide`. 

Let's check `ConfirmModal` and `BaseModal` to see if they pass `onModalWillHide`.
Plan: I will examine `src/components/ConfirmModal.tsx` and `src/components/BaseModal/index.tsx` (or `.js`) to see if `onModalWillHide` is supported or passed.

