"2. Refocusing on the keyboard when the modal is cancelled.
There'll be the case when the keyboard was not open prior to clicking the Remove, then after clicking Remove the keyboard will still show, I think there's no problem with that since the Code Input is the only input in the page so it should be focused by default..."
