If Proposal 1 waits for `keyboardDidHide` before opening the modal, then when the modal closes (after confirmation), `onModalHide` will STILL refocus the input! So the keyboard will STILL pop up on the previous screen! 
Unless... `validateCodeFormRef.current` is null because the component unmounted? 
No, `Navigation.goBack` triggers a transition, and the component doesn't unmount immediately. The `setTimeout` is 300ms, which is exactly `CONST.ANIMATED_TRANSITION`. So it fires right as the transition finishes, or slightly before. 
